  "releaseNotes": "1.2.0: Adds PdfWriter.CompressContentStreams. TextLayout.WrapText (and CountLines, MeasureHeight and DrawText through it) now keeps runs of spaces. Base 14 widths for Windows-1252 codes 128-159 are fixed, and Base 14 and TrueType fonts measure a character outside Windows-1252 as the '?' they draw. Measured widths change, so wrapped text can break differently. See CHANGELOG.md for details.",
